WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.167 --> 00:00:03.527 line:80% position:50% size:82% align:center
Ħares lejn il-Qamar illejla. Il-mudell familjari tal-pjanuri

2
00:00:03.527 --> 00:00:05.824 line:80% position:50% size:82% align:center
mudlama dejjem iħares bejn wieħed u ieħor

3
00:00:05.824 --> 00:00:07.000 line:80% position:50% size:82% align:center
fl-istess direzzjoni.

4
00:00:08.167 --> 00:00:11.466 line:80% position:50% size:82% align:center
Il-Qamar idur fuq l-assi tiegħu f’madwar 27.3

5
00:00:11.466 --> 00:00:14.180 line:80% position:50% size:82% align:center
jum. Jieħu wkoll madwar 27.3 jum biex

6
00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:15.280 line:80% position:50% size:82% align:center
idur mad-Dinja.

7
00:00:16.167 --> 00:00:19.535 line:80% position:50% size:82% align:center
Dan ir-ritmu jissejjaħ rotazzjoni sinkrona. Waqt li

8
00:00:19.535 --> 00:00:22.903 line:80% position:50% size:82% align:center
l-Qamar idur mad-Dinja, l-istess naħa tibqa’ tħares

9
00:00:22.903 --> 00:00:23.300 line:80% position:50% size:82% align:center
lejna.

10
00:00:24.167 --> 00:00:28.131 line:80% position:50% size:82% align:center
Tbandil apparenti żgħir, imsejjaħ librazzjoni, iħallina naraw

11
00:00:28.131 --> 00:00:30.730 line:80% position:50% size:82% align:center
madwar 59% tal-wiċċ tal-Qamar maż-żmien.
